  "data": {
    "cid": "8999",
    "title": "内容拓展·三",
    "category": 1,
    "header": "",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">·内容更新</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"144\" alt=\"封面头图.jpg\" title=\"封面头图.jpg\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/ebe83a185d6a66f0c08b5c2198157cba.jpg\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【深入探索】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">是有别于</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【常规行动】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的独立模式，在</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【常规行动】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中完成游戏结局一次后即可解锁</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【深入探索】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"162\" alt=\"模式介绍图02.jpg\" title=\"模式介绍图02.jpg\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250214/e34b9ca62a5ed234076f9d14beff9371.jpg\"/></div><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">该模式下的故事环境会有所变化，包含</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">&lt;不成熟的想法&gt;、&lt;当点子来敲门&gt;、&lt;及时转换思路&gt;、&lt;有理有据有节&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">4种条目类型。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">不同的探索条目附带独特的初始参数（目标生命值、希望、源石锭、编队人数等）及故事探险的探索条件，将会带来多样而有趣的探险体验。</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"303\" title=\"模式介绍图01.png\" alt=\"模式介绍图01.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20250305/fff5f5c70467bd055a472fec01cfda02.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">选择探索条目参与探险，完成探索目标可获得一次性奖励！</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"159\" alt=\"解锁介绍图.png\" title=\"解锁介绍图.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/71e618f4426370551c80234d287b322f.png\"/></div><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">完成</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">&lt;不成熟的想法&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中任意一个探索目标后，将会解锁</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">&lt;当点子来敲门&gt;</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"background-color:#1f1f1f\">条目</span></span>类型中的所有探索条目。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">完成</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">&lt;当点子来敲门&gt;</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中任意一个探索目标后，将会解锁</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">&lt;及时转换思路&gt;</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"background-color:#1f1f1f\">条</span></span>目类型中的所有探索条目。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">完成</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">&lt;及时转换思路&gt;</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中任意一个探索目标后，将会解锁</span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">&lt;有理有据有节&gt;</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"background-color:#1f1f1f\">条目</span></span>类型中的所有探索条目。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.75em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">*</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【深入探索】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中可能出现的收藏品、事件等，其解锁状态与您当前</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【巫仪档案库】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中的解锁状态无关，也无法解锁</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【巫仪档案库】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">或更新藏品的拥有状态。该模式不会对【萨卡兹的无终奇语蚀刻章套组】和分队解锁进度进行计数。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.75em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">*</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【深入探索】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的所有条目将会常驻，可以随时游玩。</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·调查条目内容前瞻</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"147\" alt=\"挑战模式章节图01.png\" title=\"挑战模式章节图01.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/401e028361109e894e7d82a09a4dbb66.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条目</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">语奇终无</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。始开将即想畅的地大脱超</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索目标</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">到达第五层【虚实疆界】</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条件</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始持有收藏品罗德岛战术电台、锈蚀的铁锤、至宝指环</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">区域布局较为特殊，对应出现的作战有所变化</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">敌人的初始属性大幅降低，但会随着探索逐渐加强</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">众人的想象已发生改变，请小心应对</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"148\" alt=\"挑战模式章节图02.png\" title=\"挑战模式章节图02.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/54ee85d8658adc3a91ec0590fd11b164.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条目</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">机械降门</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">说不清楚的成长与转变，就让“门”来代劳吧。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索目标</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">击败5次“门”</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条件</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始持有思绪巫术、收藏品佣兵的饰物、赤金的远征</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">巫术的掉落概率大幅提升</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">进阶干员所需希望大幅提升</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">众人的想象已发生改变，请小心应对</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"149\" alt=\"挑战模式章节图03.png\" title=\"挑战模式章节图03.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/98a21b628ba0d4d0dd9dea2b434c3638.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条目</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">魔王与苦难</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">你已经受够那些关于魔王和苦难的故事了，萨卡兹明明还有许多能讲的！</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索目标</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">到达第五层</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条件</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始持有4个遭诅古物</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">失与得出现的概率小幅提升</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">每经过一个失与得节点额外获得3希望、2源石锭、1构想</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">众人的想象已发生改变，请小心应对</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"150\" alt=\"挑战模式章节图04.png\" title=\"挑战模式章节图04.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/3fd1b544c7239c7dacc68596eaa300dd.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条目</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">念力</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">只有想不到，没有做不到。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索目标</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">通过任意结局</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条件</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始持有思绪枯木新枝，收藏品生命熔炉之薪</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">区域布局较为特殊，去伪存真节点只在到达虚实疆界后出现</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">负荷临界点大幅提升</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">众人的想象已发生改变，请小心应对</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"151\" alt=\"挑战模式章节图05.png\" title=\"挑战模式章节图05.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/14a53339e37ab2d2d0d398ac304563dd.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条目</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">旁观者</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">比起亲身体验，你更渴望和先祖们坐在一起，旁观他人的故事。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索目标</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">经过10次狭路相逢节点</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条件</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始持有收藏品“小方块”</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">区域布局较为特殊，狭路相逢出现的频率大幅提升</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">节点可刷新次数为0</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">众人的想象已发生改变，请小心应对</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"152\" alt=\"挑战模式章节图06.png\" title=\"挑战模式章节图06.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/87dd5496f6008e334c4582434ecc8857.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条目</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">鸭个故事</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">鸭爵只是想在你的故事里随便看看，绝不是准备在这里建立什么商业帝国。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索目标</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">击败流泪小子或鸭爵或高普尼克或圆仔，至少2次</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条件</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始持有收藏品幸运硬币、莱塔尼亚荣誉勋章</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">区域布局较为特殊，非战斗节点出现的频率大幅提升</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">众人的想象已发生改变，请小心应对</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"153\" alt=\"挑战模式章节图07.png\" title=\"挑战模式章节图07.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/f2ff275366aa180a5ab9e19282defedc.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条目</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">另辟蹊径</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">没有坚不可摧的现状，只有尚未触及的灵感。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索目标</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">击败200名敌人</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条件</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始持有收藏品奥秘之手、讴歌者面纱、“讨魔义旗”</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">淬刃和折磨的掉落概率大幅提升</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">所有敌人的法抗和防御力大幅提升</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">众人的想象已发生改变，请小心应对</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"154\" alt=\"挑战模式章节图08.png\" title=\"挑战模式章节图08.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/5387f19399723680ad0a8448c0506e6b.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条目</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">焦点史诗</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">每个人都将自己最美好的想象倾注在了“英雄”们身上，于是他们理所应当地被神化，变得遥不可及。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索目标</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">通过任意结局</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条件</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始持有收藏品滚动先祖、统帅肖像</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">领袖敌人的属性大幅度提升</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">众人的想象已发生改变，请小心应对</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"155\" alt=\"挑战模式章节图09.png\" title=\"挑战模式章节图09.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/1eec994696d6020cdc99b046b31afd0b.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条目</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">脚踏实地</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">这一次，无须后方支援也能夺取胜利。</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索目标</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">击败200名敌人</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条件</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始持有收藏品漆黑的舞鞋、老近卫军之锋、活木甲</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">初始可以招募近卫、重装干员各2名</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">更容易获得近卫、重装相关的招募券和收藏品</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">众人的想象已发生改变，请小心应对</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"156\" alt=\"挑战模式章节图10.png\" title=\"挑战模式章节图10.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250108/b6eabb46457f763725c235cae4e220bb.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>探索条目</strong></span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\